{{Quote|Troopers down. Section nine.|A Stormtrooper discovers his comrades' bodies in the sector|<ref name="Rogue One" />}}
'''Section nine''' was a region of the [[Ring of Kafrene]], a trading post<ref name="Rogue One" /> located in the [[Thand sector]].<ref name="RO World Locations">{{SW|url=news/where-in-the-galaxy-are-the-worlds-of-rogue-one|text=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of ''Rogue One''?|int=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of Rogue One?}}</ref> Shortly before the [[Battle of Scarif]], [[Cassian Jeron Andor]] and [[Tivik]] met in the sector, an encounter than provided Andor with intelligence about the [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]] and led to the deaths of Tivik and two [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[stormtrooper]]s.<ref name="Rogue One" />

